- Publishing the picked part of the document into the library of the user: one
- button in the head bar, and the link of the library that comes out of it, ready
- for the palette field of another scene.
- @see ../../ARCHITECTURE.md section 5
$bog_vmap_app_publish $mol_view
	store $bog_vmap_app_publish_store
	- Property name of the picked part on the root class, empty when nothing is
	- picked. The button is off without one.
	part \
	- Declaration of the picked part, as the inspector reads it: `Name $base …`.
	source \
	- Body and styles of the part. Empty until the code editor of stage 4 keeps
	- them per part; the shape is here so that it plugs in without a change.
	js \
	css \
	- Link of the library land, empty before the first publication.
	lib_link \
	sub <= content /$mol_view
	Publish $mol_button_minor
		title \В библиотеку
		hint <= publish_hint \
		enabled <= enabled false
		click? <=> publish? null
	- The link itself is the caption, so what is copied is what is seen.
	Copy $mol_button_copy
		hint \Скопировать ссылку библиотеки для поля палитры другой сцены
		text <= lib_link
		title <= lib_link
	Note $mol_view
		sub / <= note \
